  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1800 COMMERCIAL DRIVER LICENSING",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 1800 COMMERCIAL DRIVER LICENSING\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #10523, effective 2-18-14, readopted with amendment Chapter Saf-C 1800. Amendments included the deletion of Saf-C 1803.04 titled “Renewal Commercial Driver License—75 Years of Age and Older” and Saf-C 1803.05 titled “Requirements for Oral Examination”. The number Saf-C 1803.04 was reserved for future rulemaking.\n\nDocument #14100, effective 10-18-24, readopted or readopted with amendment all of the rules in Chapter Saf-C 1800, including the deletion of the previously reserved number Saf-C 1803.04 and the renumbering of subsequent rules within Part Saf-C 1803 titled “Commercial Driver License Application Requirements” as indicated in the source notes. Document #14100 replaces all prior filings affecting the rules in the former Chapter Saf-C 1800.\n\nThe prior filings for the former rule Saf-C 1803.04 Saf-C 1805.03included the following documents:\n\n#4901, eff 8-3-90\n\n#6298, INTERIM, eff 8-3-96\n\n#6338, eff 9-25-96\n\n#8182, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRED: 3-24-05\n\n#8405, eff 8-2-05\n\n#10523, eff 2-18-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1800.html"
